# The shard root's chain fan-out tells only the first leaf, so every other
# leaf of the shard keeps its pending bucket. BroadcastStep(t,k) delivers the
# terminal to every leaf, one at a time.
MODULE: AtomicCommit
ROW: BroadcastStep(t,k)
FILE: src/lattice/BPlusTree/Grains/ShardRootGrain.TxTerminal.cs
DETECTORS: ShardRootGrainTxTerminalTests.AppendTxTerminalAsync_fans_out_terminal_to_every_leaf
SUMMARY: the per-leaf terminal fan-out reaches only the first leaf of the shard's chain

--- FIND
            var chainTasks = new Task[chain.Count];
            for (var i = 0; i < chain.Count; i++)
                chainTasks[i] = TimedApplyTxTerminalAsync(chain[i], transactionId, committed, null);
--- REPLACE
            var chainTasks = new Task[1];
            chainTasks[0] = TimedApplyTxTerminalAsync(chain[0], transactionId, committed, null);
--- END